    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Adopts the dashboard build configuration and answers W-13's closing condition by running it. The answer is negative and useful: the build is not deterministic, because SvelteKit stamps a millisecond timestamp into version.json that cascades into every content hash, so the byte-comparison drift check W-13 asks for cannot be built before that is pinned. Separately, the committed artifact does not come from this source at this lockfile: a clean build emits 64 files where 55 are committed. Repairs nothing and rebuilds nothing.\n",
